    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-24-44">馬場は四角だ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-44-64">四角に歩め</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-64-84">足並そろへて</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-84-125">ホイ　トロツト　トロツト</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 8em" rend="first-line-indent(8)"><seg source="#source-125-162">青い空</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-162-182">馬場は四角だ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-182-205">四角に馳けろ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-205-231">たてがみユサユサ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-231-278">ホイ　ギヤロツプ　ギヤロツプ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 8em" rend="first-line-indent(8)"><seg source="#source-278-314">雲がとぶ</seg></p>
    </body>
